## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical IR response for Vault/root token compromise in a multi-tenant Kubernetes setup with real-world sensitivity.

## Key Concepts
- Vault audit signals and root-token risk
- Token lifecycles, leases, re-sealing, key rotation
- Namespace scoping and RBAC in Vault
- Runbooks and alert thresholds

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example runbook trigger pseudo-code
if (vaultAudit.detects('root_login')) {
  revokeAllRootTokens();
  rotateRootToken();
  isolateNamespaces();
  rotateMasterKeys();
}
```

